    **** again it's better to do "by hand"
    L [G(2*d)] =    (F(a + d) - F(a)*F(b + d)*[1/F(b)]
           - 2*F(b)*F(2*d)*f(b + c)*[1/f(2*b)]  + F(c)*F(2*d)
           - F(c)*F(d)*F(b + d)*[1/F(b)] + F(d)*F(c + d))*[1/F(b)];
    id G(2*d) = [G(2*d)];
